%% Mental Health Companion System - Master Sequence Diagram
%% Complete System Overview
%% Academic Style - Left to Right Format

sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant A as Admin
    participant UI as User Interface
    participant Auth as Authentication (1.0)
    participant Mood as Mood Tracking (2.0)
    participant Journal as Journal Management (3.0)
    participant Chat as AI Chatbot (4.0)
    participant Med as Meditation & Resources (5.0)
    participant Profile as Profile Management (6.0)
    participant Admin as Admin Panel (7.0)
    participant DB as Database (D1-D8)
    participant API as External API (OpenRouter AI)
    
    Note over U,API: System Overview - All 7 Subprocesses
    
    rect rgb(240, 240, 240)
    Note over U,DB: 1.0 Authentication Management
    U->>UI: Enter Credentials
    UI->>Auth: Login/Signup Request
    Auth->>DB: Query/Insert User (D1)
    DB-->>Auth: Return User Data
    Auth-->>UI: Return Session Token
    UI-->>U: Grant Access to Dashboard
    end
    
    rect rgb(240, 240, 240)
    Note over U,DB: 2.0 Mood Tracking
    U->>UI: Record Mood Entry
    UI->>Mood: Submit Mood Data
    Mood->>DB: Insert Mood Entry (D2)
    DB-->>Mood: Confirm Entry
    Mood->>Mood: Apply Strategy Pattern Analysis
    Mood-->>UI: Return Analysis & Suggestions
    UI-->>U: Display Mood Insights
    end
    
    rect rgb(240, 240, 240)
    Note over U,DB: 3.0 Journal Management
    U->>UI: Create Journal Entry
    UI->>Journal: Submit Journal Data
    Journal->>Journal: Apply Factory Pattern (Type Selection)
    Journal->>Journal: Perform Sentiment Analysis
    Journal->>DB: Insert Journal Entry (D3)
    DB-->>Journal: Return Entry ID
    Journal-->>UI: Return Success & Sentiment
    UI-->>U: Display Journal Dashboard
    end
    
    rect rgb(240, 240, 240)
    Note over U,API: 4.0 AI Chatbot Service
    U->>UI: Send Chat Message
    UI->>Chat: Submit Message
    Chat->>DB: Store User Message (D4)
    DB-->>Chat: Confirm Storage
    Chat->>API: Request AI Response
    API->>API: Process with DeepSeek Chat v3.1
    API-->>Chat: Return AI Response
    Chat->>DB: Store Bot Message (D4)
    DB-->>Chat: Confirm Storage
    Chat-->>UI: Return Bot Response
    UI-->>U: Display Chat Conversation
    end
    
    rect rgb(240, 240, 240)
    Note over U,DB: 5.0 Meditation & Resources
    U->>UI: Access Meditation Page
    UI->>Med: Request Resources
    Med->>Med: Calculate Daily Tip (Deterministic Algorithm)
    Med->>DB: Fetch Tip & Resources (D5, D6)
    DB-->>Med: Return Data
    Med-->>UI: Return Tips & Resources
    UI-->>U: Display Meditation Content
    end
    
    rect rgb(240, 240, 240)
    Note over U,DB: 6.0 Profile Management
    U->>UI: Update Profile
    UI->>Profile: Submit Profile Changes
    Profile->>DB: Query Statistics (D1, D2, D3, D4)
    DB-->>Profile: Return Aggregated Stats
    Profile->>DB: Update User Profile (D1)
    DB-->>Profile: Confirm Update
    Profile-->>UI: Return Updated Profile
    UI-->>U: Display Profile Page
    end
    
    rect rgb(240, 240, 240)
    Note over A,DB: 7.0 Admin Panel
    A->>UI: Access Admin Dashboard
    UI->>Admin: Verify Admin Role
    Admin->>DB: Query All Databases (D1-D6)
    DB-->>Admin: Return System Statistics
    Admin->>Admin: Generate Analytics Report
    Admin-->>UI: Return Analytics Dashboard
    UI-->>A: Display System Analytics
    end
    
    Note over U,API: Complete System Flow<br/>All 7 DFD Subprocesses Covered
